#. module: eh_account_dynamic_reports
#: model:eh.account.dynamic.report,description:eh_account_dynamic_reports.report_executive_summary
msgid ""
"Board-pack KPI and ratio statement: profitability (revenue, "
"gross/operating/net profit and margins), cash and liquidity (cash position, "
"receivables, payables, net working capital) and the core ratios (current, "
"quick, DSO, DPO, return on assets). Single-pass SUM aggregates per KPI; "
"reconciles to the live dashboard and to Profit and Loss / Balance Sheet for "
"the same window. Divide-by-zero-safe ratios render n/a. Cash, receivable and"
" payable rows drill to journal items."
msgstr ""

